The antecedent observes a call outcome and imposes no correctness law.
Source: base/rational.jl:20-26. -/
def CheckedDenSignbitFailure : Prop :=
  ∀ (World T Neg NotBool R : Type)
    (ops : CheckedDenOps (EStateM ArrayError World) T Neg NotBool R)
    (num den : T) (initial after : World) (error : ArrayError),
    ops.signbit den initial = .error error after →
    checkedDenTyped ops num den initial = .error error after

