/-- Independent mathematical outcome for native same-component Rational
construction. The zero pair is invalid. Otherwise the positive mathematical
gcd determines the unique reduced pair with nonnegative denominator and the
original quotient sign, including signed infinities. Success stores this
pair exactly when both normalized components fit the target; all remaining
cases are OverflowError. There is no success, nonzero, normalization or
